# CleanFlow - Smart Adaptive Cleaning Planner

## 🌟 App Overview

**CleanFlow** is a smart, flexible home-cleaning planner designed for people who struggle to stay focused or organized. It combines intelligent scheduling, paper-based checklists, and optional family collaboration — all powered by adaptive learning.

### Core Philosophy
CleanFlow isn't just a cleaning app — it's a **companion for focus and calm**. It adapts to your lifestyle, respects your pace, and supports everyone in the home — from kids learning responsibility to adults finding balance and flow.

## 🏠 Core Features

### 1. Smart Home Setup
During setup, users specify:
- Home size (number of rooms, floors, outdoor areas)
- Pets (cats, dogs, etc.)
- Cleaning devices (robot vacuum, etc.)
- Custom detail level (minimal or full control)

The app then automatically generates a **personalized cleaning plan**.

### 2. Adaptive Cleaning Plans
The system produces:
- **Daily Plan** — short routines to maintain cleanliness
- **Weekly Plan** — deeper, less frequent tasks
- **Seasonal/Custom Plans** — spring cleaning, holidays, etc.

Plans adapt dynamically based on:
- Home configuration
- Task completion history
- Personal habits and preferred order

### 3. Learning Engine (AI Behavior Model)
The app *learns* from your actions:
- Which tasks you complete, delay, or skip
- Actual cleaning durations
- Preferred times and energy patterns
- Typical comments (e.g., "ran out of detergent")

It then automatically adjusts:
- Task frequency
- Time estimates
- Cleaning order
- Focus level (shorter or longer sessions)

### 4. Focus & Energy Modes
- **Focus Mode:** Guided 10–15 minute micro-sessions (Pomodoro style)
- **Full Reset:** Deep-cleaning mode for weekends
- **Low Energy Mode:** Light, achievable plan when tired
- **Pet Mode:** Adjusts routines for homes with animals

## 🖨️ Paper & Hybrid Features

### 5. Printable Daily Plan
Users can generate a **printable PDF** version of their daily or weekly plan.

Options:
- Simple or detailed layout
- With or without QR codes
- Assignments per person or shared plan

Each printout includes:
- Tasks grouped by room
- Checkboxes for "Done / Skipped"
- Time fields
- Comment lines
- Optional **QR codes** for digital tracking

### 6. QR-Based Task Feedback
Each printed task has a **QR code** linking to a lightweight mobile web form.

When scanned, it opens a form for:
- Task completion status
- Time tracking
- Comments and notes

Data collected from QR submissions updates your stats:
- Task completion
- Time accuracy
- Missing items or notes

This enables effortless syncing from paper → app.

### 7. OCR Scan Import
After filling out the printed sheet manually:
- Take a photo or scan it
- The app's OCR reads:
  - Checkmarks ("done / skipped")
  - Written time durations
  - Comments or issues

AI analyzes the input and updates your learning profile automatically.

## 🧒 Single-Room / Kids Focus Mode

### Purpose
A mode designed for:
- **Children** — to make cleaning their own room easy and fun
- **Teenagers or ADHD users** — to focus on one small, achievable area

### Features
- "Clean only one room" generator
- Simple steps with icons and big text
- Optional timer and visual rewards
- Printable version with large checkboxes
- QR codes for marking completion
- Parents can scan and view progress or notes

## 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family Mode — Shared Home, Shared Plan

### Purpose
Enable the entire household to share one home setup and divide tasks smoothly.

### Features
- One shared "Home" profile
- Multiple family members (with names, colors, or avatars)
- Automatic or manual task assignment
- Personal task views ("My plan for today")
- Combined family progress tracker ("80% done!")
- Printable overview with everyone's duties

The app tracks:
- Individual completion history
- Workload fairness
- Rotation (e.g., "bathroom duty switches weekly")

## 🎨 3D Avatar System

### Clara - Your AI Cleaning Assistant
CleanFlow features **Clara**, a 3D avatar assistant that provides personalized cleaning guidance through natural conversation.

### 3D Avatar Features
- **Real-time 3D Rendering**: SceneView/Filament integration with GLB loading
- **Skeletal Animation**: Idle loops, blinking, and lip-sync animations
- **Customizable Avatars**: Import custom .glb files or use bundled Clara
- **Lip-Sync Technology**: Viseme-based mouth animation synchronized with speech
- **Performance Optimized**: 60 FPS target with graceful degradation
- **Offline Support**: Works without internet using bundled Clara GLB

### Avatar Management
- **Import System**: Support for local .glb files and HTTPS URLs
- **Asset Validation**: GLB magic bytes check and content hashing
- **License Tracking**: Documented license notes for imported avatars
- **Pronunciation Editor**: Customize avatar name pronunciation (Phonetic, IPA, SSML)
- **Performance Diagnostics**: Real-time FPS, memory, and asset statistics

### Technical Implementation
- **Provider Abstractions**: Backend-agnostic API for future 3D generation services
- **Database Integration**: Room database with avatar_assets table
- **Encrypted Storage**: Avatar preferences stored securely
- **File Management**: Content hashing and deduplication
- **Bundled Assets**: Clara GLB (924KB) included in app assets

## 🌍 Multi-Language Support

### Supported Languages
- **English** (en) - Default
- **Spanish** (es) - Español
- **French** (fr) - Français  
- **German** (de) - Deutsch
- **Ukrainian** (uk) - Українська

### Language Features
- **Real-time Switching**: Change language mid-conversation without interruption
- **Atomic Turn Cancellation**: Prevents mixed language audio/text
- **Session-based Configuration**: Language settings applied per conversation
- **Turn Versioning**: Discards stale packets from previous language turns
- **Clean Switchover**: 300ms transition time between languages
- **No Duplicate Greetings**: Single greeting per language switch

### Technical Implementation
- **WebSocket-based**: Language changes sent via session.update
- **Response Cancellation**: Active responses cancelled before language switch
- **Local Playback Control**: Audio stopped and flushed during transition
- **Transcript Management**: Clear old language text before new language
- **Queuing System**: Rapid language switches handled gracefully

## 🎙️ Realtime Voice Support

### OpenAI Realtime API Integration
CleanFlow features **bidirectional voice conversation** with Clara using OpenAI's Realtime API.

### Voice Features
- **Real-time Audio Streaming**: WebSocket-based bidirectional audio
- **Automatic Turn Detection**: Server-side Voice Activity Detection (VAD)
- **Simultaneous Transcription**: Real-time speech-to-text for both user and Clara
- **Low Latency**: 320ms-1s response time (6-12x faster than previous pipeline)
- **Natural Conversation**: Feels like talking to a real person

### Technical Specifications
- **Audio Format**: PCM16 (16-bit linear PCM) at 24kHz mono
- **Transport**: Base64 encoded audio over WebSocket
- **Turn Detection**: Server-side VAD with 0.5 threshold and 700ms silence duration
- **Audio Components**: Android AudioRecord for input, AudioTrack for output
- **State Management**: Comprehensive state tracking (Idle, Connecting, Connected, UserSpeaking, ClaraSpeaking)

### Voice States
- **Idle**: Ready to start conversation
- **Connecting**: Establishing WebSocket connection
- **Connected**: Ready for voice input
- **UserSpeaking**: User is talking (VAD active)
- **ClaraSpeaking**: Clara is responding with transcript
- **SessionComplete**: Conversation ended with full transcript
- **Error**: Connection or processing error

### WebSocket Messages
**Input (Client → Server)**:
- `session.update` - Configure voice, language, instructions
- `input_audio_buffer.append` - Stream audio chunks
- `input_audio_buffer.commit` - Finalize audio buffer
- `response.create` - Request response generation

**Output (Server → Client)**:
- `response.audio.delta` - Audio chunk from Clara
- `response.audio_transcript.delta` - Text chunk from Clara
- `conversation.item.input_audio_transcription.completed` - User's speech transcribed
- `input_audio_buffer.speech_started/stopped` - VAD events

## 🧠 Intelligence & Motivation

### Dynamic Recommendations
The app gently suggests improvements:
- "This task took longer — increase its estimate?"
- "You ran out of detergent twice this week — add to shopping list?"
- "You skipped dusting often — merge it into another session?"

### Progress Motivation
- Visual progress rings per day or family
- Positive, non-judgmental tone
- Optional ambient sound or light gamification

## 🎨 Design Philosophy
- Minimalist, calm interface (Notion + Calm style)
- Voice commands ("What should I clean today?")
- Gentle animations and sound cues
- Never guilt-driven — purely supportive

## ⚙️ Technical Architecture

| Layer | Description |
|-------|--------------|
| **Knowledge Graph** | Structured hierarchy of rooms, tasks, frequencies, and contexts |
| **AI Engine** | Learns from habits, times, and feedback (QR or OCR) |
| **3D Avatar System** | Real-time rendering with lip-sync and animation |
| **Realtime Voice API** | WebSocket-based bidirectional audio conversation |
| **Multi-language Engine** | Atomic language switching with turn cancellation |
| **Paper Bridge** | PDF generator + QR encoder for hybrid users |
| **OCR Engine** | Reads physical checklists back into digital data |
| **Family Sync** | Shared home state with user-based filtering and task assignment |
| **Offline Support** | QR and local cache work without connection |

## 🔮 Future Expansion
- NFC task check-ins (tap instead of scan)
